BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:milos-adamas-panigiri-of-agia-triada-adamas-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270620
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270622
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Agia Triada\, Adamas
LOCATION:Adamas\, Milos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The port town's big feast: vespers at Agia Triada on Pentecost Sunday evening\, a procession of the icon along the Adamas waterfront\, then from about 21:30 an island glenti with live violin and lute\, dancing by the local KAPI dance group and food on the church forecourt\; liturgy follows on Whit Monday morning. It's a short walk from any hotel in Adamas\, so no car needed — just arrive by 21:00 for a seat.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/milos/#adamas-panigiri-of-agia-triada-adamas
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/milos/#adamas-panigiri-of-agia-triada-adamas
END:VEVENT
