LOCATION:Korfos\, Milos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The hamlet of Korfos\, on the road to Emporios\, hosts one of the liveliest late-July feasts on Milos: vespers at 20:30 on 26 July followed by a full-band glenti (violin\, laouto\, keyboards\, drums) that runs into the small hours\, with liturgy at 08:00 next morning. Parking is on the roadside verges\; arrive before 21:00 or expect a walk.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/milos/#korfos-panigiri-of-agios-panteleimon-korfos
