DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20280817
SUMMARY:Dormition feast at Panagia Portiani\, Zefyria
LOCATION:Zefyria\, Milos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Zefyria\, the island's old capital\, celebrates the Dormition at Panagia Portiani with vespers and bread-blessing at 20:00 on 14 August\, liturgy at 07:30 on the 15th and the glenti itself on the evening of 15 August\, with a band (violin\, bouzouki\, keyboards\, laouto\, vocals) and refreshments in the churchyard. Because the party is on the 15th rather than the eve\, you can do Adamas on the 14th–15th and Zefyria the same night — the two are ten minutes apart by car.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/milos/#zefyria-dormition-feast-at-panagia-portiani-zefyria
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/milos/#zefyria-dormition-feast-at-panagia-portiani-zefyria
